            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Respondents further claim that the sole basis for agency jurisdiction is the adjacency of the wetland to a non\u2011navigable, unnamed ditch dug for a sewer system."
